WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.309 --> 00:00:03.540
Have you ever been walking on the beach and
happened upon a tidepool?

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:09.300
Suddenly, you find an entire world contained
in that pool of water; little creatures swimming

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:14.190
around and going about their lives, completely
oblivious to the giant watching them from

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:15.190
above.

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:19.929
There’s something incredible about that,
the way whole worlds can exist inside something

00:00:19.929 --> 00:00:21.199
so small.

00:00:21.199 --> 00:00:26.330
In the Central Sahara Desert, the SCP Foundation
discovered a tiny world of their own like

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:30.970
nothing anyone has ever seen before: SCP-6011,
also known as The Flat Earth.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:34.710
Not to be confused with the Flat Earth your
least favorite aunt keeps posting about over

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:35.710
on Facebook.

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:38.870
SCP-6011 is a circular area hanging about
5 centimeters in the air.

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:45.080
The radius of the area spans roughly 500 meters
and is buried 156 meters below the ground

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:47.460
within a deposit of limestone.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.140
The SCP exists as a two-dimensional plane,
three-dimensional objects passing through

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:54.260
as if they were not there at all.

00:00:54.260 --> 00:01:00.170
All of the materials found within SCP-6011,
both organic and inorganic, resemble their

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:02.300
three-dimensional counterparts.

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:09.840
There are a wide variety of living organisms
within SCP-6011, designated SCP-6011-1.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:15.530
The smallest instance of SCP-6011-1 resembles
ordinary earth-based single-celled organisms.

00:01:15.530 --> 00:01:22.580
The most notable species of SCP-6011-1 is
referred to as Plana hominem, the closest

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:26.119
thing SCP-6011 has to human beings.

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:31.090
Members of Plana hominem resemble the side
profile of a human, with a visible head that

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:34.130
includes a brain, a nose, and an eye.

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:39.530
They also have distinct muscular, lymphatic,
respiratory, digestive, nervous, endocrine,

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:42.600
cardiovascular, urinary, and reproductive
systems.

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:46.990
The only way for Plana hominem to move is
via several cilia-like structures that they

00:01:46.990 --> 00:01:49.250
can also use to pick up objects.

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:55.749
Dr. Michalis was assigned to head the research
into SCP-6011 and its various residents.

00:01:55.749 --> 00:02:00.529
In pursuit of further knowledge of Plana hominem,
Dr. Michalis decided to select a subject to

00:02:00.529 --> 00:02:03.630
interview about the nature of SCP-6011.

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:08.960
He settled on an educated individual named
Iotis, and decided to initiate contact.

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:13.569
Iotis was playing a game alone in his office
when Dr. Michalis played a short, high-pitched

00:02:13.569 --> 00:02:17.150
noise on a speaker suspended 5 centimeters
above them.

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:20.430
Startled by the sound, Iotis reacted, calling
out “Pardon?”

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:26.319
When Dr. Michalis spoke, Iotis was immediately
perplexed and frightened, unable to see where

00:02:26.319 --> 00:02:27.940
his voice was coming from.

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:32.319
He moved around the room, feeling the walls,
searching for the source of the mysterious

00:02:32.319 --> 00:02:37.200
voice as Dr. Michalis insisted that they move
to the North and stop looking.

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:41.990
Iotis threatened to call the police, accusing
Dr. Michalis of being a thief who had invaded

00:02:41.990 --> 00:02:42.990
his home.

00:02:42.990 --> 00:02:47.820
Dr. Michalis attempted to calm Iotis down,
reminding him that his yelling would disturb

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:49.689
his son and daughter.

00:02:49.689 --> 00:02:54.269
This only upset the subject further, and he
accused Michalis of being a stalker in addition

00:02:54.269 --> 00:02:55.330
to a thief.

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:59.909
Finally, Dr. Michalis was able to subdue the
Subject by insisting that he was not a thief

00:02:59.909 --> 00:03:02.540
or a stalker, but a messenger.

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:06.790
He promised no harm would come to Iotis or
his family if they would just listen to what

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:08.090
he had to say.

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:13.269
Michalis identified himself as a doctor, bonding
with Iotis over their shared education.

00:03:13.269 --> 00:03:17.790
Iotis requested that Michalis show himself,
and, since he was unable to do so, he briefly

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:21.030
lowered a mechanical piston into the surface
of SCP-6011.

00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:27.659
Though Michalis was unable to cross into SCP-6011,
this allowed him to introduce a physical presence

00:03:27.659 --> 00:03:29.190
into the area.

00:03:29.190 --> 00:03:33.689
After their conversation, Iotis agreed to
participate in another interview.

00:03:33.689 --> 00:03:37.930
This particular conversation was cut short
when two police officers approached the house

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:40.350
after noise complaints from the neighbors.

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:44.820
Iotis called out to Michalis as he left, referring
to him as “Angel.”

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:50.180
Following this initial contact and the interview
that ensued, Dr. Michalis and his team performed

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:52.659
several other interviews with Iotis.

00:03:52.659 --> 00:03:57.629
As more information was collected via observation
and conversation, Michalis decided to put

00:03:57.629 --> 00:04:03.260
together a seminar and Q&amp;A with Junior Researchers
at the Foundation regarding the details of

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:05.250
SCP-6011.

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:11.300
During the seminar, Dr. Michalis explained
the nature of SCP-6011 and its discovery.

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:15.900
It was first happened upon by Italian colonial
forces in 1912.

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:20.150
At the time, they thought it was an extended
form of the cave system, but the Foundation

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:21.250
knew better.

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:26.480
After introducing the Junior Researchers to
SCP-6011, Michalis provided more information

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:28.190
on Iotis himself.

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:32.870
He made it clear that Iotis is not to be mocked
for assuming Michalis to be an angel, explaining

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:37.250
it this way: “Imagine someone suddenly appearing
within your house.

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:40.949
Imagine someone describing the direct shape
of your insides while informing you what your

00:04:40.949 --> 00:04:43.289
relative across the country is doing.

00:04:43.289 --> 00:04:45.160
Would you not also cry out ‘Angel?

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:46.160
Angel?!

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:47.710
Where are you, Angel!’”

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:51.990
After this introductory portion, and taking
a moment to plug his book “The Life in Plane”

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:57.060
- which was co-authored by Iotis himself - Michalis
opened the floor to questions.

00:04:57.060 --> 00:05:02.210
One of the Junior Researchers asked why the
residents of SCP-6011 look so human.

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:06.300
Michalis responded with a question of his
own: “do they even look human?

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:11.240
Or is it natural for our brain to make connections
between vaguely humanoid-shaped objects, as

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:14.350
we want to feel a sense of familiarity with
them?”

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:19.620
Michalis confirmed that, after a significant
amount of testing, SCP-6011 is definitely

00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:20.620
two-dimensional.

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:23.180
Somehow, it has no width.

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:28.720
Because of this dimensional difference between
SCP-6011 and the ordinary world, nothing should

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:31.910
be removed from the boundaries of the flat
world.

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:36.289
Forcing a two-dimensional object or being
into our world would cause it to either rearrange

00:05:36.289 --> 00:05:41.000
itself to fit into a three-dimensional configuration
or cause it to split apart.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:43.180
At best, it would become malformed.

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:47.740
At worst, the item would undergo instantaneous
nuclear fission.

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:52.830
Nothing can be placed inside of SCP-6011 from
the outside world either.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:56.310
Three-dimensional objects can pass through
temporarily, showing only a cross-section

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:57.389
of the object.

00:05:57.389 --> 00:06:01.970
The Foundation advises against attempting
to place any objects inside, as it would change

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:03.780
the Enthalpy of the system.

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:09.150
During his observation of SCP-6011, as well
as his interviews with Iotis, Dr. Michalis

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:13.259
uncovered a wide variety of facts about life
inside the flat earth.

00:06:13.259 --> 00:06:18.810
The Plana hominem live in a feudal society,
where people are born into a class position

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:22.500
and the role of the parents is passed along
to their offspring.

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:25.910
The social hierarchy is broken down into Estates.

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:30.509
The Estates are indicated by a color applied
under the skin of each person at their birth.

00:06:30.509 --> 00:06:35.870
There is no opportunity for upward mobility,
or for fall from grace, only to stay in the

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:38.099
position one is born into.

00:06:38.099 --> 00:06:42.120
Those of the Red estate belong to the monarchy
of SCP-6011.

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:44.090
The Orange are administrators.

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:47.190
The Yellow are priests, scribes, and record
keepers.

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:51.810
The Green are similar to the middle-class
of 18th century Europe, encompassing teachers,

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:55.400
physicians, lawyers, and other educated professionals.

00:06:55.400 --> 00:07:00.629
Blue are merchants, tradesmen, and skilled
workers, and Purple are the manual laborers.

00:07:00.629 --> 00:07:04.879
Because of the difficulty of accomplishing
tasks in only two dimensions, the upper-class

00:07:04.879 --> 00:07:07.750
citizens have at least two servants apiece.

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:11.250
All servants come from the estates ranked
below Green.

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:16.410
Because physical writing is difficult in the
boundaries of SCP-6011, members of the Yellow

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:18.819
caste are trained as “Voice Scribes.”

00:07:18.819 --> 00:07:23.639
They memorize and repeat large amounts of
information, such as entire books, transcriptions

00:07:23.639 --> 00:07:25.990
of speeches, or laws.

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:31.300
Entertainment in SCP-6011 is largely voice-based
as well, with Visual Theatres considered a

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:34.479
luxury only for the highest-class citizens.

00:07:34.479 --> 00:07:38.660
The entertainment of the common people is
found in the Voice Theater, a place where

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:43.849
entertainment is structured around dialogue
and the sound of artificially created ambiance.

00:07:43.849 --> 00:07:49.330
Naturally, the Foundation does not want any
civilians stumbling on SCP-6011.

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:54.580
Though it poses no threat to humanity, knowledge
of its existence could cause chaos and could

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:58.580
very well endanger the inhabitants of SCP-6011.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:03.380
Site 044 was set up around SCP-6011 in order
to protect it.

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:08.360
No construction is permitted within a 10-kilometer
radius of the area, under a cover story about

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:12.750
the Libyan government blocking off the area
for conservation purposes.

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:18.500
SCP-6011 is stored in a hermetically sealed
chamber, away from external influences.

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:23.560
All interactions with SCP-6011 or any of the
organisms living within it must be approved

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:27.080
by the Head Researcher of Provisional Site
044.

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:32.469
A monitoring system is set up perpendicular
to SCP-6011 so that the research team can

00:08:32.469 --> 00:08:36.530
keep an eye on the activity inside, without
disturbing the residents.

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:40.990
The monitoring system is, unfortunately, not
without its flaws.

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:45.220
One day, there was a malfunction in the system
that caused the breakdown of the camera rails,

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:50.680
and several metallic components came loose
and plunged into the surface of SCP-6011.

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:54.550
There was no damage, but the objects were
seen by several citizens.

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:58.820
The Foundation was concerned that the sight
of massive pieces of mysterious objects appearing

00:08:58.820 --> 00:09:04.040
and disappearing suddenly in a public space
would cause mass panic among the people of

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:05.040
SCP-6011.

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:09.089
However, the research team was shocked to
see the two-dimensional people carrying on

00:09:09.089 --> 00:09:11.790
with their ordinary day-to-day lives.

00:09:11.790 --> 00:09:16.140
They performed an anti-cognitohazard screening
in order to determine what was causing this

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:21.120
strangely placid response to what should have
been a devastating shock to the people.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:26.760
They discovered a large building, hidden by
a form of visual cognitohazard, shaped like

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:28.120
an octagon.

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:32.680
Further monitoring of this unusual building
captured a voice recording of a Scribe reciting

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:35.040
an account of the monitor equipment disaster.

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:39.790
Soon after, Iotis was removed from his home
by officers that refused to disclose what

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:42.140
organization they were working for.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:46.800
All of this, the building, the arrest, the
report of the incident, was traced to a secret

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:53.860
organization operating inside of SCP-6011
known as the Doctors of the Church.

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:58.019
The group was made up of Yellow and Orange
Estate members, with a small selection of

00:09:58.019 --> 00:10:00.310
Green, Blue, and Purple Field Agents.

00:10:00.310 --> 00:10:04.230
The research team could not help but notice
how similar the Doctors of the Church are

00:10:04.230 --> 00:10:06.090
to the Foundation itself.

00:10:06.090 --> 00:10:10.860
Their mission statements are very much the
same, upholding a veil of secrecy between

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:15.200
the unusual and the population they have sworn
to protect while working to understand the

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:17.740
anomalies they are trying to conceal.

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:22.019
All three-dimensional interlopers are scrubbed
from the public consciousness or hidden from

00:10:22.019 --> 00:10:23.750
the people at large.

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:28.139
Further research indicated that the incident
would have completely destroyed 6011 if the

00:10:28.139 --> 00:10:33.020
Doctors of the Church had not worked to deploy
reality anchors to keep the baseline reality

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.339
of the world intact.

00:10:34.339 --> 00:10:39.970
Dr. Michalis wrote about this group, affectionately
nicknamed “The Little Foundation,” saying:

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:43.650
“When I look at them I see – well- us.”

00:10:43.650 --> 00:10:48.490
And “A little crumb of limestone falling
from the ceiling of the karst or a bug somehow

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:53.800
making its way onto the surface of SCP-6011
— phasing in and out of existence — must

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:55.339
have terrified them.

00:10:55.339 --> 00:11:00.040
And so they found a way to conceal all that
was illogical from the general public.

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:01.040
As did we.”

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:06.920
The reality of SCP-6011 raises some fascinating,
if a bit troubling, questions.

00:11:06.920 --> 00:11:10.320
What dimensions are there that we have no
knowledge of?

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:15.269
Just as the two-dimensional being cannot conceive
of us, what four-dimensional beings, five-dimensional

00:11:15.269 --> 00:11:20.829
beings, and so on might there be out there
that we can’t begin to wrap our heads around?

00:11:20.829 --> 00:11:25.490
To a creature with no concept of a third dimension,
creatures that exist within our world seem

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:28.420
like angels or even Gods.

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:32.221
Perhaps the things in this world we cannot
explain are simply creatures that exist in

00:11:32.221 --> 00:11:35.510
more dimensions than we are able to conceive
of.

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:40.990
Truly, there may be no difference between
The Little Foundation and the SCP Foundation

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:42.550
that we know.

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:48.410
Looking down at the residents of SCP-6011,
and all that they think they know, might encourage

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:50.250
us to feel superior.

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:55.990
Instead, it should make us curious, and perhaps
even make us afraid of what we might be unable

00:11:55.990 --> 00:11:56.990
to understand.

00:11:56.990 --> 00:12:01.430
Dr. Michalis summarized his thoughts on SCP-6011
in its file:

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:06.430
“We had prior interactions with entities
that claimed to originate from higher geometrical

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:09.839
dimensions, yet our mind was never really
capable of understanding them.

00:12:09.839 --> 00:12:14.850
Where we stand, we have the capability to
imagine the lives of those in the 2-dimensional

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:15.850
space.

00:12:15.850 --> 00:12:19.740
Sadly, the same cannot be said for our understanding
of the 4-dimensional reality.

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:23.880
It is often said that the human brain is like
a computer.

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:29.279
So just like a computer can never completely
emulate a machine more advanced than itself,

00:12:29.279 --> 00:12:33.270
so do we lack the ability to understand higher
dimensions.”

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:39.510
To a creature outside of our understanding,
we are the citizens of the Flat Earth, shuffling

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:44.220
back and forth, unable to see that which lies
beyond.

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:50.199
Now go check out “SCP-999 - The Tickle Monster”
and “SCP-978 - Desire Camera” for more

00:12:50.199 --> 00:12:52.449
Safe but Scintillating SCP’s!

